hub=Come in. There is always time to make sure you are well.
quest.title=A Place to Recover
quest.description=Build Elara a clinic to care for injured residents and guards.
quest.objective.token=Collect the clinic plot token from Elara.
quest.objective.build=Build the clinic.
quest.objective.talk=Return to Elara.
bye=See you later.
how=Tell me about your work.
offer=Would you open a clinic in our town?
finish=The clinic is ready.
progress=About your clinic...
accept=Let us build it.
later=Perhaps later.
offer.body=Your guards need somewhere safe to recover between expeditions. A waiting room, a small ward and a medicine cabinet would let me look after them here. Bring Lesser Health Potions to keep the cabinet supplied.
accepted.body=Here is the clinic plan. Keep the aisle beside the beds open so our patients can reach me.
cancel=I need to put this project aside.
building.body=I will keep my things packed until the clinic is ready. The plot plan lists the materials we need.
cancelled.body=All right. Find me when you are ready to begin again.
back=Understood.
welcome.body=The ward is ready. Ask me about clinic care to donate medicine and see who needs help. Bring injured guards here with Follow, then let them wait nearby while they recover.
how.body=I treat one injured resident at a time inside the clinic, starting with the most serious injuries nearby. A course takes twelve quiet seconds and restores up to forty health. Each Lesser Health Potion supplies eighty points of medicine. Fighting or leaving interrupts the course without spending medicine. I cannot treat anyone while away, and the Gaia Altar remains the place for revival.
gift.confirm=You brought something for me? Let me see.
gift_love=What a thoughtful gift. I have just the place for this.
gift_like=Oh, this will be useful. Thank you.
gift_neutral=Thank you for thinking of me.
gift_dislike=I appreciate the thought, though this is not quite my sort of thing.
