greeting.0=Come in. There is always time to make sure you are well.
greeting.1=A quiet room and clean supplies can do a great deal.
greeting.2=Tell me where it hurts. We will take things one step at a time.
gift_love_birthday=You remembered my birthday! What a thoughtful gift. I have just the place for this.
