clinic=Let us check the clinic.
reward.25=You have helped make this a caring town. Take these supplies for the medicine cabinet.
reward.50=For your next journey. These remedies are stronger, so save them for when you need them.
reward.75=I trust you to bring everyone home. Take my best remedies with you.
